{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56882","headline":"闽人爲郑家八虎歌（题拟） · 佚名","name":"闽人爲郑家八虎歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾彪之虎兮往代，荀爽八龙兮典载，名不朽兮人不逢，人不逢兮名空在。\n荥阳八虎今成羣，见之避之走纷纷。\n（见宋赵与泌、黄岩孙纂《仙溪志》卷四，注出《艺文志》、《九国志》、《独〖疑有误〗实录》及《郡志》）（按：唐末诗人郑良士有子八人，皆善文学，时称郑家八虎，爲作歌。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56882.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56882","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}